<h2 class="section label"><span><span lang="de">Offene Datenpunkte</span><span lang="en">Open data points</span></span><span>23</span></h2>
<table class="rows"><colgroup><col class="w-gattr"><col class="w-bucket"><col class="w-legal"><col class="w-action"></colgroup><thead><tr><th><span lang="de">Attribut</span><span lang="en">Attribute</span></th><th><span lang="de">Einstufung</span><span lang="en">Bucket</span></th><th><span lang="de">Rechtsgrundlage</span><span lang="en">Legal reference</span></th><th><span lang="de">Nächster Schritt</span><span lang="en">Next step</span></th></tr></thead></table>
<details class="group" open><summary><span class="name"><span lang="de">After-Sales- oder Serviceabteilung des Pack-Herstellers; oft der Hersteller selbst plus autorisierte Servicepartner.</span><span lang="en">After-sales or service department of the pack manufacturer; often the manufacturer itself plus authorised service partners.</span></span><span class="label count">1</span></summary><table class="rows"><colgroup><col class="w-gattr"><col class="w-bucket"><col class="w-legal"><col class="w-action"></colgroup><tbody>
<tr><td class="attr"><span class="dot none" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="n"><span lang="de">Bezugsquellen für Ersatzteile</span><span lang="en">Sources for replacement spare parts</span></span><code>sparePartSources</code></td><td class="label"><span lang="de">Pflicht</span><span lang="en">required</span></td><td class="refs">BR Annex XIII 2 (b)<br>DIN longlist: Annex XIII (2b)</td><td class="note wide"><span lang="de">Diesen Wert anfordern. Typischer Datenhalter: After-Sales- oder Serviceabteilung des Pack-Herstellers; oft der Hersteller selbst plus autorisierte Servicepartner.</span><span lang="en">Request this value. Typical data holder: After-sales or service department of the pack manufacturer; often the manufacturer itself plus authorised service partners.</span></td></tr>
</tbody></table></details>
