<tr><td class="attr"><span class="dot none" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="n"><span lang="de">Kapazitätsdurchsatz</span><span lang="en">Capacity throughput</span></span><code>capacityThroughput</code></td><td class="label"><span lang="de">bedingt</span><span lang="en">conditional</span></td><td class="refs">DIN longlist: Annex VII Part B (3)</td><td class="note wide"><span lang="de">Prüfen, ob dies für Ihre Batterie zutrifft; falls ja, den Wert anfordern. Typischer Datenhalter: Ladungszähler des Batteriemanagementsystems (BMS).</span><span lang="en">Confirm whether this applies to your battery; if it does, request the value. Typical data holder: Battery management system (BMS) charge counter.</span></td></tr>
</tbody></table></details>
