<details class="group" open><summary><span class="name"><span lang="de">Batteriemanagementsystem (BMS) oder periodische Messungen des Betreibers.</span><span lang="en">Battery management system (BMS) or the operator&#39;s periodic measurements.</span></span><span class="label count">1</span></summary><table class="rows"><colgroup><col class="w-gattr"><col class="w-bucket"><col class="w-legal"><col class="w-action"></colgroup><tbody>
